{"kind":"assert","text":"NF-5 Voice ruling on de0c1f16: the plan is accepted with one\nchange, and the emit finding is repaired in NF-5 before commit C.\n\n1. The statechart route. Accepted. Copy the scripts to a scratch\n   directory outside the checkout, call the stock `worker.ts`\n   there, and change the one line of `run.ts` that deletes the TLC\n   directory. Record the hash of each copied file and of the\n   changed file. The home skill files stay unchanged. Nothing is\n   deleted.\n2. The two intervals. Accepted: the control and the targeted source\n   run at commit C, then the coverage pin and `check.mjs Voice` at\n   commit Q. The pin moves only after the results at C pass.\n3. The control. Accepted: add the stable assertion message at the\n   restart-negative arm, and name that message in `controls.json`.\n4. The diagram, changed. The model, the config and the view do not\n   change. Compare the generated `chart.mmd` with the tracked\n   `verification/state-machines/Voice/chart.mmd`. When the bytes\n   are equal, the tracked `chart.svg` stands, and no renderer runs.\n   When the bytes differ, stop and report the difference. Get no\n   Pele copy before that report.\n5. The emit finding (`start` emits `speaking`, then calls `play`\n   with no second check). Repair it in NF-5, before commit C. After\n   the emit, check the generation and the active turn again. When\n   either changed, start no playback. The saved audio start stays,\n   so the next load blocks a new Arm until Check, as after an\n   interruption. Add one witness: a subscriber disposes during the\n   emit, `play` is not called, and the saved start stays.\n   Why in NF-5: this head already changes the protected source and\n   moves the pin. A later head would pay the control and the check\n   a second time.\n6. If the repair of item 5 needs a change to `Voice.tla`, stop and\n   report. That change is then its own request.\n\nOrder: this interval takes the slot after the NF-5 source repairs\nand the merge of the main that holds R1. R1 keeps the slot now.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}